title: "Dairy CIP Digital Twin: Synthetic MATLAB/Simulink Proof-of-Concept"
abstract: "Simulation framework for auditing the robustness of Pareto-optimal alkaline cleaning-in-place recipes: a synthetic MATLAB/Simulink proof-of-concept of a dairy pipe circuit with assumed parameters, and (folder revision_R2) the benchmark of the alkaline removal kinetics against published whey-protein cleaning curves, the audit of the experimentally calibrated case and the tests beyond the calibration data."
